# Presence (TEMPO-06): the server records who has the game open. Every seat starts away; the game
# is live while every Methuselah still in it is present, and async otherwise. Presence changes
# show on the seats, not in the log, and only the server can make them.
seed 11
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *8
library A "Iron Ward" *20
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *8
library B "Signal Fire" *20
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *8
library C "Quick Feed" *20
start
expect present A no
expect tempo async

present A yes
present B yes
expect tempo async
present C yes
expect present C yes
expect tempo live
# Nothing for the log.
log A

# Bob drops out of the game long enough to count as away, then comes back.
present B no
expect present B no
expect tempo async
present B yes
expect tempo live

# An ousted Methuselah no longer counts: once Bob is out, the others decide the tempo.
present B no
expect tempo async
B> pool -30
expect ousted B true
expect tempo live

# A replacement player is away until the server sees them.
admin> replace C erin
expect present C no
expect tempo async
present C yes
expect tempo live
